{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4037090/extras/f7e9d8c8a70b5d03aa2eb8a09b6df808.poster.avif?t=1768490038\" width=800 height=70 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4037090/extras/f7e9d8c8a70b5d03aa2eb8a09b6df808.webm?t=1768490038\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4037090/extras/f7e9d8c8a70b5d03aa2eb8a09b6df808.mp4?t=1768490038\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arcane Rivals is a combo\u2011based, voice\u2011interactive PvP fighting game. Quickly weave hand signs (<strong>Make Handsigns</strong>), then speak the name of the spell into your mic to unleash the technique (<strong>Cast Jutsus via Voice</strong>). Reflexes, timing, and clear pronunciation are the keys to victory.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4037090/extras/9c97ea71b9b8cdc7339bcc26923ceb27.poster.avif?t=1768490038\" width=800 height=70 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4037090/extras/9c97ea71b9b8cdc7339bcc26923ceb27.webm?t=1768490038\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4037090/extras/9c97ea71b9b8cdc7339bcc26923ceb27.mp4?t=1768490038\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Make Handsigns</strong> \u2013 Execute the hand signs you\u2019ve learned in the correct order; the longer the sequence, the stronger the technique.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cast Jutsus via Voice</strong> \u2013 Say the name of the spell into your microphone; timing and correct pronunciation affect success.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chain and counter</strong> \u2013 Link techniques together, interrupt your opponent\u2019s moves, and seize the momentum.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4037090/extras/e423dec9f20f552551649c33501e265e.poster.avif?t=1768490038\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4037090/extras/e423dec9f20f552551649c33501e265e.webm?t=1768490038\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Highlights</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Voice\u2011controlled combat:</strong> Cast by speaking into your mic; your voice drives the flow of battle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Combo\u2011focused mechanics:</strong> Combine hand signs to build short or extended chains.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Anime\u2011inspired flair:</strong> Fast, flashy techniques and energy\u2011packed effects.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PvP\u2011first:</strong> Short, high\u2011tempo duels where knowledge, reflexes, and voice mastery shine.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Microphone required:</strong> For the best experience, a headset + microphone is recommended.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>In the arena, both your voice and your hands lead\u2014weave your signs, seal the spell with your voice, and take down your rival!</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4037090/extras/a5e0633c22c49e70c1960a4dfab85c9a.poster.avif?t=1768490038\